    "claim_text": "Kufferath began studying Danzan-ryu Jujitsu under Seishiro Henry Okazaki in 1937 at the Kodenkan dojo in Honolulu. Because Kufferath was fluent in Japanese, Okazaki taught him the complete system in Japanese. He trained six days a week and earned his black belt in May 1941.",
